2 CONT '''Lucien Bonaparte''', brother of Emperor Napoleon I of France.  Lucien held genuinely revolutionary views, which led to an often abrasive relationship with his brother Napoleon, who seized control of the French government in 179
2 CONC 9, when Lucien was 24.
