1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Wikipedia''': [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pauline_Bonaparte English], [https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pauline_Bonaparte Français]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Pauline Bonaparte''' born 20 October 1780, died 9 June 1825.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pauline_Bonaparte
2 CONT
2 CONT Paula Maria Bonaparte Leclerc Borghese (French: Pauline Marie Bonaparte, pronounced [pɔlin maʁi bɔnapaʁt]; 20 October 1780 – 9 June 1825), better known as Pauline Bonaparte, was an imperial French princess, the first sovereign Duc
2 CONC hess of Guastalla, and the princess consort of Sulmona and Rossano. She was the sixth child of Letizia Ramolino and Carlo Buonaparte, Corsica's representative to the court of King Louis XVI. Her elder brother, Napoleon, was the fi
2 CONC rst emperor of the French. She married Charles Leclerc, a French general, a union ended by his death in 1802.
2 CONT
2 CONT Later, Pauline married Camillo Borghese, 6th Prince of Sulmona. Her only child, Dermide Leclerc, born from her first marriage, died in childhood. She was the only Bonaparte sibling to visit Napoleon in exile on his principality, E
2 CONC lba.
2 CONT
