2 CONT Bartolomeo dei Principi Ruspoli (October 26, 1800 – 1872), married Carolina Ratti (1805–1881), and had eight children:
2 CONT
2 CONT >#    Francesca dei Principi Ruspoli (Rome, May 31, 1830 – Florence, December 14, 1902), married firstly in Rome, December 21, 1852 Giovanni Torlonia dei Duchi di Poli e Guadagnolo and secondly in Basel, November 4, 1863 Nikolai .
