1 NOTE COUNT WALEWSKI; NATURAL SON
1 NOTE Alexander Walewski, aka Alexandre Florian Joseph Colonna, natural son of Napoleon Bonapart and Countess Marie Walewska of Poland, was born in 1810.  He became a naturalized citizen of France, a French diplomat; served in the Frenc
2 CONC h Army 1837; was a journalist in Paaris. Appointed Minister to Florence 1849; Naples (1850); and Ambassador to Spain (1851); Great Britain (1851) Minister of French Foreign Affairs (1855-1860); and President of the French Legislat
2 CONC ure (1865.)  He died in 1868.
