1 NOTE Da kong Oscar 1. d°de, blev han efterfulgt af s°nnen Karl 15., som regerede Sverige-Norge fra 1859-1872.
1 NOTE During his liberal and popular rule, numerous reforms were instituted. The 
2 CONT most important was in 1867 when the Riksdag, the Swedish legislature, 
2 CONT became a bicameral body, with the upper house chosen by provincial 
2 CONT representatives and the lower house by popular election (although suffrage 
2 CONT was based on property and earnings). Charles was interested in literature 
2 CONT and the arts and wrote a volume of poems. Having no male heirs, he was 
2 CONT succeeded by his brother Oscar II.
