1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~langolier/Augusta_Washington/ps66/ps66_049.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ROME, Dec. 5.--Prince Enrico Ruspoli died to-day at his chateau at Nemi. He was born at Rome in 1877, and on March 2, 1901, at Washington he married Mrs. Enfield Bruton, widow of a wealthy manufacturer of Nashville, who was Miss E
2 CONC ugenia Berry, of Oak Hill, Ga. Prince Enrico Ruspoli was the second son of Prince Luigi Ruspoli and cousin of Prince Francesco Ruspoli, the head of one of the oldest and most famous Italian families. An uncle, Prince Paoli, marrie
2 CONC d Miss Rosalie Van Zandt, of New York.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT no issue
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francesco_Ruspoli,_3rd_Prince_of_Cerveteri
