0 @N6000000002176689055@ NOTE A beautiful and strong-willed girl, she was married at the age of 14 and bore
1 CONT 8 children, with Napoleon being one of them. Once her son Napoleon was exiled
1 CONT to the island of Elba in 1814, he never saw his wife and only son again.
1 CONT Having escaped Elba in Mar-15-1815, he marched into Paris winning over the
1 CONT soldiers sent to capture him. Later, at the Battle of Waterloo, he was
1 CONT defeated on Jun-18-1815 and exiled to the Island of Saint Helena, where he
1 CONT died of stomach cancer, like his father.
